# Views: the map spinning a quarter four times round the cursor (caught on its way), the cursor kept in place, the D-pad
# moving as on screen in a turned view, a turn asked for while one runs ignored; then the narrowing style.
nosave
test 1
wait 70
shot v00-view0
turn 1
wait 4
shot v01-spinning
wait 3
shot v02-spinning-on
wait 10
shot v03-view1
checklayer
key RIGHT
key RIGHT
shot v04-view1-right
turn 1
turn 1
wait 16
shot v05-view2
checklayer
turn 1
wait 16
turn 1
wait 16
shot v06-view0-again
checklayer
turnstyle 1
turn -1
wait 4
shot v07-narrowing
wait 12
shot v08-view3
checklayer
turnstyle 0
turn 1
wait 16
checklayer
